msgid "the Northeast"
msgstr "der Nordosten"

msgid "Appalachia"
msgstr "die Appalachen"

msgid "the Great Lakes"
msgstr "die Großen Seen"

msgid "the Upper Midwest"
msgstr "der obere Mittlere Westen"

msgid "the Corn Belt"
msgstr "der Corn Belt"

msgid "the Heartland"
msgstr "das Kernland"

msgid "the Southern Plains"
msgstr "die südlichen Great Plains"

msgid "the Mid-South"
msgstr "der mittlere Süden"

msgid "the Atlantic Southeast"
msgstr "der atlantische Südosten"

msgid "the Gulf Coast"
msgstr "die Golfküste"

msgid "Florida"
msgstr "Florida"

msgid "the Rockies"
msgstr "die Rockies"

msgid "the Great Basin"
msgstr "das Große Becken"

msgid "the Desert Southwest"
msgstr "der Wüsten-Südwesten"

msgid "California"
msgstr "Kalifornien"

msgid "the Pacific Northwest"
msgstr "der pazifische Nordwesten"

msgid ""
"Original welcome-sign copy pairing each state's well-known nickname with a "
"widely-documented fact or landmark; roadside register, facts not invented."
msgstr ""
"Eigene Begrüßungsschilder, die den bekannten Spitznamen jedes Bundesstaats "
"mit einer gut belegten Tatsache oder Sehenswürdigkeit verbinden; im Ton von "
"Straßenschildern, Fakten nicht erfunden."

msgid "Alabama"
msgstr "Alabama"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Alabama, the Yellowhammer State. Home of the rockets that "
"carried the first men to the moon, designed right here in Huntsville."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Alabama, dem Yellowhammer State. Heimat der Raketen, die die "
"ersten Menschen zum Mond gebracht haben, entwickelt genau hier in "
"Huntsville."

msgid "Arizona"
msgstr "Arizona"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Arizona, the Grand Canyon State, where the canyon turns out to "
"be even bigger than the billboards promised."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Arizona, dem Grand Canyon State, wo der Canyon sogar noch "
"größer ist, als die Plakate versprochen haben."

msgid "Arkansas"
msgstr "Arkansas"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Arkansas, the Natural State. Home of a former president, and the "
"one place in America you can dig your own diamonds and keep them."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Arkansas, dem Natural State. Heimat eines ehemaligen "
"Präsidenten und der einzige Ort in Amerika, an dem du selbst nach Diamanten "
"graben und sie behalten darfst."

msgid ""
"Welcome to California, the Golden State. More people, more traffic, and "
"more of that burger stand with the palm trees than you can shake a stick at."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Kalifornien, dem Golden State. Mehr Menschen, mehr Verkehr "
"und mehr von dieser Burgerbude mit den Palmen, als du zählen kannst."

msgid "Colorado"
msgstr "Colorado"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Colorado, the Centennial State, where the plains finally quit "
"and the Rocky Mountains take over all at once."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Colorado, dem Centennial State, wo die Ebene endlich aufhört "
"und die Rocky Mountains auf einen Schlag übernehmen."

msgid "Connecticut"
msgstr "Connecticut"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Connecticut, the Constitution State, birthplace of the "
"hamburger, the Frisbee, and a great many very old stone walls."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Connecticut, dem Constitution State, Geburtsort des "
"Hamburgers, des Frisbees und sehr vieler sehr alter Steinmauern."

msgid "Delaware"
msgstr "Delaware"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Delaware, the First State, first to ratify the Constitution and "
"proud enough to say so right on the sign."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Delaware, dem First State, der als erster die Verfassung "
"ratifiziert hat und stolz genug ist, das gleich aufs Schild zu schreiben."

msgid "District of Columbia"
msgstr "District of Columbia"

msgid ""
"Welcome to the District of Columbia, the nation's capital. Monuments, "
"museums, and traffic circles that confuse everyone who drives them. "
"Including you."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen im District of Columbia, der Hauptstadt des Landes. Denkmäler, "
"Museen und Kreisverkehre, die jeden verwirren, der sie fährt. Dich "
"eingeschlossen."

msgid ""
"Welcome to Florida, the Sunshine State. Oranges, alligators, and a theme "
"park about the size of a small country."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Florida, dem Sunshine State. Orangen, Alligatoren und ein "
"Freizeitpark, ungefähr so groß wie ein kleines Land."

msgid "Georgia"
msgstr "Georgia"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Georgia, the Peach State. Home of peaches, pecans, and the fizzy "
"brown drink that went and conquered the world."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Georgia, dem Peach State. Heimat von Pfirsichen, Pekannüssen "
"und dem sprudelnden braunen Getränk, das die Welt erobert hat."

msgid "Idaho"
msgstr "Idaho"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Idaho, the Gem State. Famous potatoes. It says so right on the "
"license plate, so it must be true."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Idaho, dem Gem State. Berühmte Kartoffeln. Steht so auf dem "
"Nummernschild, also muss es stimmen."

msgid "Illinois"
msgstr "Illinois"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Illinois, the Prairie State. Land of Lincoln, deep-dish pizza, "
"and the start of the mother road, Route sixty-six."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Illinois, dem Prairie State. Land of Lincoln, Deep-Dish-Pizza "
"und der Anfang der Mother Road, der Route sechsundsechzig."

msgid "Indiana"
msgstr "Indiana"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Indiana, the Hoosier State, home of the greatest spectacle in "
"racing and more rows of corn than a driver can count."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Indiana, dem Hoosier State, Heimat des größten Spektakels im "
"Rennsport und mehr Maisreihen, als ein Fahrer zählen kann."

msgid "Iowa"
msgstr "Iowa"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Iowa, the Hawkeye State, where the corn is high, the ground is "
"flat, and somebody carved a baseball diamond into a cornfield."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Iowa, dem Hawkeye State, wo der Mais hoch steht, der Boden "
"flach ist und jemand ein Baseballfeld in ein Maisfeld geschnitten hat."

msgid "Kansas"
msgstr "Kansas"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Kansas, the Sunflower State. Flat as a tabletop, and yes, "
"Dorothy really was from here."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Kansas, dem Sunflower State. Flach wie eine Tischplatte, und "
"ja, Dorothy kam wirklich von hier."

msgid "Kentucky"
msgstr "Kentucky"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Kentucky, the Bluegrass State. Bourbon, horse races, and fried "
"chicken worth crossing a state line for."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Kentucky, dem Bluegrass State. Bourbon, Pferderennen und "
"Brathähnchen, für das sich eine Fahrt über die Staatsgrenze lohnt."

msgid "Louisiana"
msgstr "Louisiana"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Louisiana, the Pelican State, where the food is spicy, the music "
"never quite stops, and the swamp starts at the shoulder."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Louisiana, dem Pelican State, wo das Essen scharf ist, die "
"Musik nie ganz aufhört und der Sumpf am Seitenstreifen beginnt."

msgid "Maine"
msgstr "Maine"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Maine, the Pine Tree State. Lobster, lighthouses, and the very "
"first sunrise in the nation."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Maine, dem Pine Tree State. Hummer, Leuchttürme und der "
"allererste Sonnenaufgang im ganzen Land."

msgid "Maryland"
msgstr "Maryland"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Maryland, the Old Line State. Crab cakes, and the harbor that "
"gave us the rockets' red glare."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Maryland, dem Old Line State. Krabbenküchlein und der Hafen, "
"der uns das rote Leuchten der Raketen aus der Nationalhymne geschenkt hat."

msgid "Massachusetts"
msgstr "Massachusetts"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Massachusetts, the Bay State, where the Revolution kicked off "
"and everybody still drives like it."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Massachusetts, dem Bay State, wo die Revolution begann und "
"alle immer noch so fahren."

msgid "Michigan"
msgstr "Michigan"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Michigan, the Great Lakes State. Hold up your right hand: that "
"is your map. Home of the automobile."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Michigan, dem Great Lakes State. Heb deine rechte Hand: Das "
"ist deine Landkarte. Heimat des Automobils."

msgid "Minnesota"
msgstr "Minnesota"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Minnesota, the North Star State. Ten thousand lakes, give or "
"take, and winters that absolutely mean it."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Minnesota, dem North Star State. Zehntausend Seen, mehr oder "
"weniger, und Winter, die es absolut ernst meinen."

msgid "Mississippi"
msgstr "Mississippi"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Mississippi, the Magnolia State, birthplace of the blues and "
"namesake of the mighty river on its western border."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Mississippi, dem Magnolia State, Geburtsort des Blues und "
"Namensvetter des mächtigen Flusses an seiner Westgrenze."

msgid "Missouri"
msgstr "Missouri"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Missouri, the Show-Me State, the gateway to the West, with a "
"giant steel arch to prove it."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Missouri, dem Show-Me State, dem Tor zum Westen, mit einem "
"riesigen Stahlbogen als Beweis."

msgid "Montana"
msgstr "Montana"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Montana, Big Sky Country. More cattle than people, and a sky "
"that earns the nickname every single evening."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Montana, Big Sky Country. Mehr Rinder als Menschen und ein "
"Himmel, der sich den Spitznamen jeden einzelnen Abend verdient."

msgid "Nebraska"
msgstr "Nebraska"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Nebraska, the Cornhusker State. Corn, corn-fed beef, and the "
"original Cabela's waiting for you out on Interstate eighty."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Nebraska, dem Cornhusker State. Mais, maisgefüttertes "
"Rindfleisch und das originale Cabela's, das draußen an der Interstate "
"achtzig auf dich wartet."

msgid "Nevada"
msgstr "Nevada"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Nevada, the Silver State, where the desert glitters after dark "
"and the odds are never quite in your favor."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Nevada, dem Silver State, wo die Wüste nach Einbruch der "
"Dunkelheit glitzert und die Chancen nie ganz auf deiner Seite sind."

msgid "New Hampshire"
msgstr "New Hampshire"

msgid ""
"Welcome to New Hampshire, the Granite State. Live free or die, and no sales "
"tax. They are not kidding about either one."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in New Hampshire, dem Granite State. Live free or die, und keine "
"Umsatzsteuer. Mit beidem ist es ihnen ernst."

msgid "New Jersey"
msgstr "New Jersey"

msgid ""
"Welcome to New Jersey, the Garden State. It really is a garden once you are "
"past the turnpike, and somebody else will pump your gas."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in New Jersey, dem Garden State. Hinter dem Turnpike ist es "
"wirklich ein Garten, und tanken tut hier jemand anders für dich."

msgid "New Mexico"
msgstr "New Mexico"

msgid ""
"Welcome to New Mexico, the Land of Enchantment. Red or green chile on "
"everything, and night skies the flying-saucer crowd swears by."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in New Mexico, dem Land of Enchantment. Rotes oder grünes Chili "
"auf allem und ein Nachthimmel, auf den die Ufo-Fans schwören."

msgid "New York"
msgstr "New York"

msgid ""
"Welcome to New York, the Empire State. One very large city, and an even "
"larger amount of state that nobody ever tells you about."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in New York, dem Empire State. Eine sehr große Stadt und noch "
"viel mehr Bundesstaat, von dem dir nie jemand erzählt."

msgid "North Carolina"
msgstr "North Carolina"

msgid ""
"Welcome to North Carolina, the Tar Heel State, first in flight and home of "
"the original pulled-pork argument."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in North Carolina, dem Tar Heel State, Erster in der Luftfahrt "
"und Heimat des ursprünglichen Streits über Pulled Pork."

msgid "North Dakota"
msgstr "North Dakota"

msgid ""
"Welcome to North Dakota, the Peace Garden State, home of the world's "
"largest buffalo and a whole highway lined with giant metal sculptures."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in North Dakota, dem Peace Garden State, Heimat des größten "
"Bisons der Welt und eines ganzen Highways voller riesiger Metallskulpturen."

msgid "Ohio"
msgstr "Ohio"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Ohio, the Buckeye State, birthplace of aviation and more "
"astronauts and presidents than really seems fair to the other states."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Ohio, dem Buckeye State, Geburtsort der Luftfahrt und Heimat "
"von mehr Astronauten und Präsidenten, als den anderen Bundesstaaten "
"gegenüber fair erscheint."

msgid "Oklahoma"
msgstr "Oklahoma"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Oklahoma, the Sooner State, where the wind comes sweeping down "
"the plain, exactly like the song promised."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Oklahoma, dem Sooner State, wo der Wind über die Ebene fegt, "
"genau wie es das Lied versprochen hat."

msgid "Oregon"
msgstr "Oregon"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Oregon, the Beaver State. Waterfalls, giant trees, and a "
"coastline that fights the Pacific to a draw."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Oregon, dem Beaver State. Wasserfälle, riesige Bäume und eine "
"Küste, die sich mit dem Pazifik ein Unentschieden liefert."

msgid "Pennsylvania"
msgstr "Pennsylvania"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Pennsylvania, the Keystone State, where the country was founded "
"and the sandwiches come smothered in cheese."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Pennsylvania, dem Keystone State, wo das Land gegründet wurde "
"und die Sandwiches unter Käse begraben kommen."

msgid "Rhode Island"
msgstr "Rhode Island"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Rhode Island, the Ocean State. Small enough to cross on your "
"lunch break, and serious about coffee milk and hot wieners."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Rhode Island, dem Ocean State. Klein genug, um es in der "
"Mittagspause zu durchqueren, und sehr ernst, was Kaffeemilch und Hot "
"Wieners angeht."

msgid "South Carolina"
msgstr "South Carolina"

msgid ""
"Welcome to South Carolina, the Palmetto State, home of a giant sombrero "
"tower."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in South Carolina, dem Palmetto State, Heimat eines riesigen "
"Sombrero-Turms."

msgid "South Dakota"
msgstr "South Dakota"

msgid ""
"Welcome to South Dakota, the Mount Rushmore State. Four presidents carved "
"into a mountain, and free ice water down the road at Wall Drug."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in South Dakota, dem Mount Rushmore State. Vier Präsidenten in "
"einen Berg gemeißelt und kostenloses Eiswasser weiter die Straße runter bei "
"Wall Drug."

msgid "Tennessee"
msgstr "Tennessee"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Tennessee, the Volunteer State. Music City, Graceland, and hot "
"chicken that fights back."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Tennessee, dem Volunteer State. Music City, Graceland und "
"scharfes Hähnchen, das sich wehrt."

msgid "Texas"
msgstr "Texas"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Texas, the Lone Star State, where everything really is bigger, "
"including the drive to get across it."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Texas, dem Lone Star State, wo wirklich alles größer ist, "
"auch die Fahrt, um es zu durchqueren."

msgid "Utah"
msgstr "Utah"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Utah, the Beehive State. Red-rock arches, blinding salt flats, "
"and a lake you can float in like a cork."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Utah, dem Beehive State. Rote Felsbögen, blendende Salzebenen "
"und ein See, in dem du treibst wie ein Korken."

msgid "Vermont"
msgstr "Vermont"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Vermont, the Green Mountain State. Maple syrup, covered bridges, "
"and ice cream from Waterbury."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Vermont, dem Green Mountain State. Ahornsirup, überdachte "
"Brücken und Eiscreme aus Waterbury."

msgid "Virginia"
msgstr "Virginia"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Virginia, the Old Dominion, birthplace of a whole shelf of "
"presidents, and, so the sign insists, for lovers."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Virginia, dem Old Dominion, Geburtsort eines ganzen Regals "
"voller Präsidenten und, wie das Schild beharrlich sagt, für Verliebte."

msgid "Washington"
msgstr "Washington"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Washington, the Evergreen State. Coffee, rain, apples, and a "
"volcano keeping a quiet eye on things."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Washington, dem Evergreen State. Kaffee, Regen, Äpfel und ein "
"Vulkan, der still ein Auge auf alles hat."

msgid "West Virginia"
msgstr "West Virginia"

msgid ""
"Welcome to West Virginia, the Mountain State. Almost heaven, they say, and "
"the roads do wind exactly like the song."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in West Virginia, dem Mountain State. Fast der Himmel, sagt man, "
"und die Straßen winden sich genau wie im Lied."

msgid "Wisconsin"
msgstr "Wisconsin"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Wisconsin, the Badger State. Cheese, more cheese, and a giant "
"waterpark town they simply call the Dells."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Wisconsin, dem Badger State. Käse, noch mehr Käse und eine "
"riesige Wasserpark-Stadt, die einfach the Dells heißt."

msgid "Wyoming"
msgstr "Wyoming"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Wyoming, the Equality State, first to let women vote, home of "
"Old Faithful and a great deal of wide-open nobody."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen in Wyoming, dem Equality State, dem ersten, der Frauen wählen "
"ließ, Heimat von Old Faithful und einer Menge weiter, menschenleerer "
"Landschaft."

