#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{lead}Leased to {carrier_name}."
msgstr "{lead}Unter Vertrag bei {carrier_name}."

#. placeholders: {lead}, {carrier_name}, {level}, {title}, {readiness}, {transponder}, {next_business_unlock}
msgid ""
"{lead}Leased to {carrier_name}. Level {level}: {title}. Gross revenue is "
"higher. You pay fuel, repairs, maintenance reserve, insurance, trailer "
"program, truck reserve, and settlement fees. "
"{readiness}{transponder}{next_business_unlock}"
msgstr ""
"{lead}Unter Vertrag bei {carrier_name}. Level {level}: {title}. Der "
"Bruttoumsatz ist höher. Du zahlst Kraftstoff, Reparaturen, "
"Wartungsrücklage, Versicherung, Aufliegerprogramm, Lkw-Rücklage und "
"Abrechnungsgebühren. {readiness}{transponder}{next_business_unlock}"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Settlements are driver wages and bonuses."
msgstr "Abrechnungen sind Fahrerlohn und Prämien."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"The carrier supplies the tractor, fuel, repairs, trailer, authority, and "
"insurance."
msgstr ""
"Die Spedition stellt Zugmaschine, Kraftstoff, Reparaturen, Auflieger, "
"Lizenz und Versicherung."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The owner-operator buy-in stays open here if you change your mind."
msgstr ""
"Der Einstieg als selbstständiger Fahrer bleibt hier offen, falls du es dir "
"anders überlegst."

#. placeholders: {carrier_name}, {level}, {title}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"You are a company driver for {carrier_name} by choice, level {level} "
"{title}."
msgstr ""
"Du bist aus Überzeugung angestellter Fahrer bei {carrier_name}, Level "
"{level} {title}."

#. placeholders: {carrier_name}, {level}, {title}, {company_ladder_next}
msgid ""
"You are a company driver for {carrier_name} by choice, level {level} "
"{title}. The carrier supplies the tractor, fuel, repairs, trailer, "
"authority, and insurance. Settlements are driver wages and bonuses. The "
"owner-operator buy-in stays open here if you change your mind. "
"{company_ladder_next}"
msgstr ""
"Du bist aus Überzeugung angestellter Fahrer bei {carrier_name}, Level "
"{level} {title}. Die Spedition stellt Zugmaschine, Kraftstoff, Reparaturen, "
"Auflieger, Lizenz und Versicherung. Abrechnungen sind Fahrerlohn und "
"Prämien. Der Einstieg als selbstständiger Fahrer bleibt hier offen, falls "
"du es dir anders überlegst. {company_ladder_next}"

#. placeholders: {grouped}, {grouped2}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"The buy-in costs {grouped} dollars and keeps {grouped2} dollars of working "
"capital in the bank."
msgstr ""
"Der Einstieg kostet {grouped} Dollar, und {grouped2} Dollar Betriebskapital "
"bleiben auf der Bank."

#. placeholders: {carrier_name}, {level}, {title}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "You are a company driver for {carrier_name}, level {level} {title}."
msgstr ""
"Du bist angestellter Fahrer bei {carrier_name}, Level {level} {title}."

#. placeholders: {carrier_name}, {level}, {title}, {grouped}, {grouped2}
msgid ""
"You are a company driver for {carrier_name}, level {level} {title}. You "
"qualify for the owner-operator buy-in: you buy the truck you drive and keep "
"hauling for the carrier as a leased-on owner-operator. The buy-in costs "
"{grouped} dollars and keeps {grouped2} dollars of working capital in the "
"bank."
msgstr ""
"Du bist angestellter Fahrer bei {carrier_name}, Level {level} {title}. Du "
"erfüllst die Voraussetzungen für den Einstieg als selbstständiger Fahrer: "
"Du kaufst den Lkw, den du fährst, und fährst als selbstständiger Fahrer "
"unter Vertrag weiter für die Spedition. Der Einstieg kostet {grouped} "
"Dollar, und {grouped2} Dollar Betriebskapital bleiben auf der Bank."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"You qualify for the owner-operator buy-in: you buy the truck you drive and "
"keep hauling for the carrier as a leased-on owner-operator."
msgstr ""
"Du erfüllst die Voraussetzungen für den Einstieg als selbstständiger "
"Fahrer: Du kaufst den Lkw, den du fährst, und fährst als selbstständiger "
"Fahrer unter Vertrag weiter für die Spedition."

#. placeholders: {carrier_name}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Company driver for {carrier_name}."
msgstr "Angestellter Fahrer bei {carrier_name}."

#. placeholders: {carrier_name}, {level}, {title}, {menu_summary}, {next_business_unlock}
msgid ""
"Company driver for {carrier_name}. Level {level}: {title}. {menu_summary} "
"The carrier supplies the tractor, fuel, repairs, trailer, authority, and "
"insurance. Settlements are driver wages and bonuses. {next_business_unlock}"
msgstr ""
"Angestellter Fahrer bei {carrier_name}. Level {level}: {title}. "
"{menu_summary} Die Spedition stellt Zugmaschine, Kraftstoff, Reparaturen, "
"Auflieger, Lizenz und Versicherung. Abrechnungen sind Fahrerlohn und "
"Prämien. {next_business_unlock}"

#. placeholders: {menu_summary}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{menu_summary} The carrier supplies the tractor, fuel, repairs, trailer, "
"authority, and insurance."
msgstr ""
"{menu_summary} Die Spedition stellt Zugmaschine, Kraftstoff, Reparaturen, "
"Auflieger, Lizenz und Versicherung."

